  <Fragment slot="intro">
    µTorrent's desktop app for the Mac stopped working with macOS Catalina in 2019. Mac users get µTorrent Web instead, which runs inside your browser. If you'd rather have a real app, OrbTorrent is free, open source and has no ads.
